## Day 26 -- Packages n Services, Route53, InitContainer, Status Script

## Ansible

---
- name: Install and enable services
  hosts: all
  become: true

  tasks:
    - name: Install Services
      dnf:
        name:
          - httpd
          - firewalld
        state: present

    - name: Enable and start services
      service:
        name: "{{ iten }}"
        state: started
        enabled: yes
      loop:
        - httpd
        - firewalld


